===Noun===
{{en-noun|walleyes|walleye}}

# {{lb|en|plural "walleyes"}} One or a pair of sideways-looking misaligned [[eye]]s.
# {{lb|en|plural "walleyes"}} An unusually [[pale]] eye.
# {{lb|en|plural "walleye" or "walleyes"}} A species of [[gamefish]], {{taxlink|Sander vitreus|species|noshow=1}}, native to the Northern U.S. and Canada with pale, reflective eyes.

